{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 255 of 256 points\n  defined for: 1..255\n  undefined e.g. at x=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "where is 1/x defined for x an unsigned byte", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: u8) = 1/x", "domain it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "x != 0  (in 1/x)"}], "defined_points": 255, "points": 256, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 1, "undefined_example": "x=0", "c_ub_example": "x=0"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: u8) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: u8, 0..255\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 255 of 256 points\n  defined for: 1..255\n  undefined e.g. at x=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x in 1..10) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: int, 1..10\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 10 of 10 points\n  over all 10 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "where is 1/x defined where x is between 1 and 10", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x in 1..10) = 1/x", "domain it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "x != 0  (in 1/x)"}], "defined_points": 10, "points": 10, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 0}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x in 1..10) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: int, 1..10\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 10 of 10 points\n  over all 10 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x: i8) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: i8, -128..127\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  C assumes not (1 == min and x == -1)  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 255 of 256 points\n  defined for: -128..-1, 1..127\n  undefined e.g. at x=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "where is 1/x defined for x a signed byte", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x: i8) = 1/x", "domain it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "domain", "conditions": [{"kind": "requires", "text": "x != 0  (in 1/x)"}, {"kind": "c_assumes", "text": "not (1 == min and x == -1)  (in 1/x)"}], "defined_points": 255, "points": 256, "exhaustive": true, "c_ub_points": 1, "undefined_example": "x=0", "c_ub_example": "x=0"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x: i8) = 1/x\n  ucas: domain it\ndomain of it:\n  x: i8, -128..127\n  requires x != 0  (in 1/x)\n  C assumes not (1 == min and x == -1)  (in 1/x)\n  defined at 255 of 256 points\n  defined for: -128..-1, 1..127\n  undefined e.g. at x=0\n  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0\n  over all 256 points of the domain\n"}, "isError": false}}
